==Description==
'''Titus Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Hexscape Event]]. It was a reward for the Triumpher of All Nights badge, obtained by triumphing all nights in a row without losing.

==Appearance==
'''Titus Charm''' appearance is based on [[Titus]] from the [[Failed Gateway|Night 1]] of the [[Hexscape Event]]. It has [[Titus]] standing on a rock while creating an orb of dark matter with its metal hand. Placing it down makes it play a sound of [[Titus]] saying "''I must say, I'm unimpressed''".

The color of '''Titus Charm''' depends on the username color of the player in the chat, though it is orange in its inventory preview.

